abstract: "An open documentation kit for building and running an information security, privacy and AI governance programme: original policy, procedure, plan, template and playbook documents in Markdown and Word, and Excel registers with prepared rows, covering ISO/IEC 27001:2022, ISO/IEC 27701, SOC 2 Trust Services Criteria, GDPR operations and AI governance, with a crosswalk between them."
